{"title":"2014 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 1a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The pie chart shows the distribution of the number of bronze, silver and gold medals in a school’s trophy case.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>(add image on problem 1 page: 2x degrees for Bronze, 3x degrees for Silver and right angle for Gold)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the pie chart, we see that the angles are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/1/cc1f7b9ee941ed17936b57793cd516c9c7605d40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x)^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"43\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/c/b4c551764ad02b349814b60ff1cd7cca3efc8b06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3x)^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"43\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/7/6a7dfa8a2a90d521b2b03f5b82a1fb9f85dce88c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90^{\\circ}$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" />. Since these angles form a complete revolution, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/b/84b411c06eab5766a0071afa4c6b029d8952ae6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x)^{\\circ} + (3x)^{\\circ} + 90^{\\circ} = 360^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"214\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/d/97df96a5833fdfc6d550555527aaea278218ce76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5x)^{\\circ} + 90^{\\circ} = 360^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"150\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41cbb7efd551ce874c68ca79416c380042501d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5x)^{\\circ} = 360^{\\circ} - 90^{\\circ} = 270^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"209\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/e/e2e147170480d3976f8b296ccf624ab8307ea2e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{270}{5} = \\boxed{54}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"121\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017043850\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 42/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 983/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1548/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   21.666      1 2014_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%   21.666      1 -total\n 24.03%    5.207      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35628:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017043850 and revision id 278072. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}